    "title": "Concept 1: Understanding Speed",
    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Speed is a compound measure that tells us how fast something is moving. It is calculated by dividing the distance traveled by the time taken. Common units include metres per second (m/s), kilometres per hour (km/h), and miles per hour (mph).</p>",
